&lt;/xacro:macro&gt;
</code></pre>

\[ \begin{aligned} I_{xx} &amp;= I_{yy} = I_{zz} = \frac{2}{5} m r^2 \\ I_{xy} &amp;= I_{yz} = I_{zx} = 0 \\ \end{aligned} \] <pre><code>&lt;xacro:macro name="sphere_inertia" params="r m"&gt;
